WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.000
[Music; pop quiz with dental assisting students]

00:00:09.060 --> 00:00:11.060
Hey. Hello.

00:00:11.060 --> 00:00:16.000
For your exit question, what is the order for putting on your PPE?

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:20.000
So, you put on your gown first, okay?

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:22.000
[Inaudible]

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:23.000
[Bell]

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:26.000
What does PPE stand for?

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:30.000
PPE means personal protective equipment.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:31.000
[Bell]

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:36.000
What is the third molar on the lower left?

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:37.000
Seventeen.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:38.000
[Bell]

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:46.000
What color is the [inaudible] cartridge?

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:47.000
Black.

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:48.000
[Bell]

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:57.000
What color is the needle used for number twenty?

00:00:57.000 --> 00:00:58.000
[Bell]

00:00:58.000 --> 00:00:59.000
Oh my God!

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:13.000
For your exit question, what surface is the cutting surface of the tooth?

00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:14.000
What surface?

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:15.000
Cutting surface.

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:16.000
Cutting?

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:17.000
Yes.

00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:18.000
[Bell]

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:19.000
Yay, you're free!

00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:20.000
[Bell]

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:28.000
What surface will be touching the tongue?

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:29.000
Lingual.

00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:30.000
Oh, good question!

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:31.000
[Bell]

00:01:31.000 --> 00:01:43.000
What color will be the needle for number eight?

00:01:43.000 --> 00:01:45.000
[Bell]

00:01:45.000 --> 00:02:04.000
What number is the lower left second molar?

00:02:04.000 --> 00:02:05.000
[Bell]

00:02:05.000 --> 00:02:06.000
Yay!

00:02:06.000 --> 00:02:14.000
What quadrant is tooth number twenty-seven?

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:22.000
Lower right.

00:02:22.000 --> 00:02:28.000
[Music; closing reaction clips]
